###Pure
Class {meta::pure::profiles::doc.doc = 'One flat chamber reading of a show-cave monitoring round. Every property is primitive and to-one; only the reading key and the three dates reconstructed from the compact numeric encoding are required, so a round that recorded nothing but its key is still valid data.'} test::solarcavern2::domain::ChamberReading
{
  readingId: Integer[1];
  chamberCode: String[0..1];
  passageName: String[0..1];
  surveyorTeam: String[0..1];
  depthM: Decimal[0..1];
  humidityPct: Decimal[0..1];
  loggedAt: DateTime[0..1];
  calibratedOn: StrictDate[0..1];
  lampActive: Boolean[0..1];
  mappedOn: DateTime[1];
  sealedOn: DateTime[1];
  sampledOn: DateTime[1];
  registryTier: String[1];
}
